cat << 'EOF' > docs/catalogs/osm.kewl.lu.md
# OSM Luxembourg Extracts Catalog

[← Back to README](../../README.md)

- **Service Key**: `osm.kewl.lu`
- **Description**: Daily extracts for the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg
